WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:06.140 --> 00:00:09.017
Benefit Cosmetics is one
of the top beauty brands

00:00:09.017 --> 00:00:10.644
for eyebrow products.

00:00:10.644 --> 00:00:12.855
Its Precisely, My Brow pencil

00:00:12.855 --> 00:00:15.524
is one of its best-
selling products.

00:00:15.524 --> 00:00:17.484
On average, it sells one

00:00:17.484 --> 00:00:20.112
brow pencil every two seconds.

00:00:20.112 --> 00:00:21.822
Talk about popular!

00:00:21.822 --> 00:00:23.991
To learn a bit more 
about what makes

00:00:23.991 --> 00:00:26.201
this brow pencil such a favorite,

00:00:26.201 --> 00:00:27.953
we got a look 
behind the scenes

00:00:27.953 --> 00:00:30.831
of how it's made at
Benefit's Tokyo factory.

00:00:39.506 --> 00:00:42.301
The process begins with
a variety of pigments.

00:00:42.301 --> 00:00:43.385
White,

00:00:43.385 --> 00:00:44.344
black,

00:00:44.344 --> 00:00:45.470
yellow,

00:00:45.470 --> 00:00:46.430
and red pigments

00:00:46.430 --> 00:00:47.639
go into the pencil.

00:00:47.639 --> 00:00:49.892
Those pigments are
combined with ingredients

00:00:49.892 --> 00:00:53.437
such as stearic acid, which
helps to thicken the mixture

00:00:53.437 --> 00:00:56.982
and prevent the pencil
from smearing on your brow.

00:00:56.982 --> 00:00:59.484
From there, wax 
and oils are added

00:00:59.484 --> 00:01:01.236
to bind all the
ingredients together.

00:01:01.987 --> 00:01:03.864
Benefit's brow pencil requires

00:01:03.864 --> 00:01:06.033
a variety of waxes and oils,

00:01:06.033 --> 00:01:07.826
including fruit wax,

00:01:07.826 --> 00:01:08.785
beeswax,

00:01:08.785 --> 00:01:10.454
and coconut oil.

00:01:10.454 --> 00:01:12.372
Once everything is combined,

00:01:12.372 --> 00:01:15.125
the mixture is poured into
a large rolling machine.

00:01:15.125 --> 00:01:17.586
The machine triple-
rolls the formula,

00:01:17.586 --> 00:01:20.631
turning it into the
consistency of pencil shavings.

00:01:20.631 --> 00:01:23.675
The loose mixture is then
compressed into a log shape,

00:01:23.675 --> 00:01:25.427
which will become
the pencil's core.

00:01:25.427 --> 00:01:28.722
More than 20,000
pieces of pencil core

00:01:28.722 --> 00:01:30.599
will come from this
compressed mixture.

00:01:31.141 --> 00:01:33.268
A machine cuts it ultra fine,

00:01:33.268 --> 00:01:35.729
making each core 
exactly the same.

00:01:35.729 --> 00:01:37.397
Once the pencils are made,

00:01:37.397 --> 00:01:39.816
there are two tests each
one has to go through

00:01:39.816 --> 00:01:41.652
before it gets 
packaged and shipped:

00:01:41.652 --> 00:01:44.821
the shade test and
the durability test,

00:01:44.821 --> 00:01:47.282
which are two of the
most important aspects

00:01:47.282 --> 00:01:50.035
of what makes Benefit's
brow pencils so unique.

00:01:50.035 --> 00:01:52.704
Deanna Tharp: So, what makes
the Precisely, My Brow pencil

00:01:52.704 --> 00:01:54.331
different from any
other brow pencil,

00:01:54.331 --> 00:01:56.416
I would say the shade range.

00:01:56.416 --> 00:01:59.586
We suit every hair
color, every skin tone.

00:01:59.586 --> 00:02:00.963
The other thing I love about it

00:02:00.963 --> 00:02:04.841
is that it is a very durable
pencil for as tiny as it is.

00:02:04.841 --> 00:02:06.260
You can put quite 
a bit of pressure,

00:02:06.260 --> 00:02:07.344
and that thing won't break.

00:02:07.344 --> 00:02:10.222
Narrator: The shade test
makes sure each pencil

00:02:10.222 --> 00:02:12.516
is the exact color
it's supposed to be.

00:02:12.516 --> 00:02:15.769
To do this, the pencils
are meticulously swatched

00:02:15.769 --> 00:02:17.229
and compared.

00:02:17.229 --> 00:02:20.107
Benefit's pencils also go
through a durability test.

00:02:20.107 --> 00:02:22.859
The core is tested to
make sure it can endure

00:02:22.859 --> 00:02:25.821
up to 25 times its own
weight without breaking.

00:02:25.821 --> 00:02:29.783
Next, the pencils are
hand-filled with the core.

00:02:29.783 --> 00:02:32.119
Each pencil is
x-rayed to make sure

00:02:32.119 --> 00:02:35.205
its quality and its
packaging are perfect.

00:02:35.205 --> 00:02:38.917
The Precisely, My Brow
pencils are then hand-packed

00:02:38.917 --> 00:02:42.838
and sent to stores in over 55
countries all over the world.

